  description="Terms and conditions for using Mantis Security services and website."
>
  <section class="py-28 md:py-36 bg-mantis-black">
    <div class="max-w-[800px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 text-center">
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-white mb-4">Terms &amp; Conditions</h1>
      <p class="text-gray-300">Last updated: March 2026</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="py-16 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-[800px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 prose prose-lg max-w-none prose-headings:text-mantis-black">
      <h2>1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
      <p>By accessing and using the Mantis Security website or engaging our services, you agree to be bound by these terms and conditions.</p>
      <h2>2. Services</h2>
      <p>Mantis Security provides professional security services including but not limited to guarding, electronic security, monitoring, risk assessments, and specialised security operations. All services are subject to a separate service agreement.</p>
      <h2>3. PSIRA Compliance</h2>
      <p>Mantis Security is fully registered with the Private Security Industry Regulatory Authority (PSIRA). All security personnel are PSIRA-certified and undergo regular compliance verification.</p>
